{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5acd62e4c4a1a53deac8","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"역시 사장님! 이번에도 내 변장을 간파했네!","speaker":"부동구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"시필드 시티","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9709045984558505042"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3682063905733829207"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ac6c619893f850f3b8e4","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"허점이 눈에 딱 띄잖아","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"시필드 시티","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7991104416669208702"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b2842bb0ba96c65ff0bb","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"사원증 말하는 거야?","speaker":"부동구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"시필드 시티","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4539614231261040570"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3682063905733829207"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-8629502890b6907a4ad6","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"헤헤, 그건 사장님을 위해 특별히 남겨둔 단서라고——안 그러면 게임하기 너무 힘들잖아!","speaker":"부동구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"시필드 시티","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7375660557769036967"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3682063905733829207"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-dd89ae432e1693277832","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"말도 마, 힘들어 죽겠어","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"시필드 시티","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14875242801880891545"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-cb086416c8c64ad42343","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s36892bbc7d6a0782","text":"사장님 고생 많